    <tags>meetings calendar reminder alarm google-calendar zoom teams google-meet productivity trial</tags>
    <summary>Rings like an incoming phone call before your Google Calendar meetings.</summary>
    <description>MeetingRinger rings like an incoming phone call before your meetings, with a persistent banner you cannot miss. Syncs Google Calendar. $1/month ($12/year) with a 14-day free trial.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/meetingringer/meetingringer/releases/tag/v0.1.29</releaseNotes>
    <dependencies>
